msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/ltm-ai-qem/api-reference) for this Function.\n"
"  - Try the [Trotterized time evolution of the 2D tilted-field Ising model with LTM AI-QEM](/tutorials/trotterized-time-evolution-ltm) tutorial.\n"
"  - Review the [functions overview](/guides/functions).\n"
"  - Learn about [managed workflows](/guides/managed-workflows).\n"
"  - Learn how to choose [problem sizes and compute profiles](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Zalecenia\">\n"
